Maintainer: InvariantFS Developers <invfs@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gcc, make, pkg-config, libfuse3-dev, zlib1g-dev, libzstd1
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/anomalyco/InvariantFS

Package: invfs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fuse3
Recommends: libjxl-tools
Description: semantic content-addressed filesystem (bit-exact invariant)
 InvariantFS is a FUSE filesystem where every compression is verified by
 decompress-and-compare before it is trusted. Containers (ZIP/TAR, disk
 images) are decomposed into member inodes that flow through the whole
 codec pipeline recursively; transcodes happen only where bit-exactness
 is proven per file. Ships the CLI tools, the FUSE daemon, the system
 codecpacks, systemd sweep/verify timers (disabled by default) and an
 initramfs-tools hook for booting from an InvariantFS root
 (rootfstype=invfs).
